# Converted with tools/mermaid-to-trace.js from GitLab documentation, doc/development/architecture.md (CC BY-SA 4.0); original in gitlab-simple.mmd
title "GitLab, simplified components"
direction down

pill HTTP: HTTP/HTTPS
pill SSH: SSH
GitLabPages: GitLab Pages
GitLabWorkhorse: GitLab Workhorse
GitLabShell: GitLab Shell
Gitaly: Gitaly
Puma: Puma (Gitlab Rails)
Sidekiq: Sidekiq (GitLab Rails)
PostgreSQL: PostgreSQL
Redis: Redis
NGINX: NGINX

HTTP -> NGINX : TCP 80,443
SSH -> GitLabShell : TCP 22
NGINX -> GitLabPages : TCP 8090
NGINX -> GitLabWorkhorse
GitLabShell -> Gitaly
GitLabShell -> GitLabWorkhorse
GitLabWorkhorse -> Gitaly
GitLabWorkhorse -> Puma
GitLabWorkhorse -> Redis
Sidekiq -> PostgreSQL
Sidekiq -> Redis
Puma -> PostgreSQL
Puma -> Redis
Puma -> Gitaly
Gitaly -> GitLabWorkhorse
